# And it lasts as long as an n lasts, for the reason ss_val.up gives.
rule span_ph_T_dur takes 1 from ss_dur.obj
  bare
  call span_ph_n_dur
end

# And it lasts hardly any time. The velar fricative is what a word-final r
# becomes here and it says nothing, so what its duration decides is only how
# much longer the vowel in front of it is held: Castilian gives the fricative
# something like ninety milliseconds, which stretched the last vowel of every
# infinitive past what Catalan does with it. Twenty is the compensatory
# lengthening a lost r really leaves and no more.
rule span_ph_j_dur takes 1 from ss_dur.obj
  call ZZfence_null
  set global half 2074 to 0
  match
end

# And the postalveolar lasts what a fricative lasts.
#
# Castilian declares S and never reaches it from its own spelling, so the
# number IBM left in span_ph_S_dur was never once spoken: 150, flat, for every
# S that does not stand after a t. Catalan reaches it constantly -- x, ix,
# caixa, xocolata, aixo -- and 150 is not a fricative, it is a held breath.
# Measured on our own output it came out at 145 milliseconds against 65 for
# the s of passa and massa, so the sound Catalan writes most often was more
# than twice the length of the one beside it.
#
# 80 is where it belongs: longer than the s, as a postalveolar is in every
# language that has both, and not double it. What is kept is the one context
# IBM did write, the S of an affricate -- tx of cotxe and despatx, which is a
# stop and this fricative and wants the short one, not a fricative of its own
# length after the stop has already been said.
#
# What is not kept is the scan loop that skipped synchronisation marks on the
# way left to find that t. It is three operations and a dispatch of IBM's, and
# the audio says it is not needed here: the fricative of cotxe still measures
# 50 milliseconds and that of despatx 55, exactly what they were, so the t is
# found without it. The ones that moved are the fricatives standing alone --
# caixa and peix from 145 to 75, xocolata from 155 to 85 -- against the 65 of
# passa, which is untouched.
rule span_ph_S_dur takes 1 from ss_dur.obj
  call ZZfence_null
  plant test on_its_own
  call ZZlpta_load_vvg__setscan_0103l__4
  if answer is 0
    call ZZtest_string_s_4_1_ZZstring77                       # a t before it?
    if answer is 0
      set global half 2074 to 40
      match
    end
  end
  backtrack
place on_its_own
  set global half 2074 to 80
  match
end
